{"seconds": 407.4, "exit": 0, "final": "3.Kf1 is forced, then Black plays Bxd4+ (discovered check from the rook on f8!) winning the bishop. All defenses lose material.\n\n**Best move:** Bf2+\n\n**Coaching note (80 words):**\nLook for forcing checks that attack multiple pieces simultaneously\u2014this is a **fork**. Here, Bf2+ checks the king while attacking the bishop on d4. The king must move (it's in check), and then you capture the bishop with Bxd4+, which is *also* check! This wins a whole piece by force. Key lesson: forcing checks create tempo and force-fulness. Always scan the position for checks combined with threats to other pieces\u2014this pattern wins material constantly at the club level.\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Bf2+\", \"line\": [\"Bf2+\", \"Kg2\", \"Rh2+\", \"Kf1\", \"Bxd4+\", \"Kg2\"], \"motifs\": [\"fork\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "1k3r1r/p1q3p1/1pP3Q1/P7/3BB3/2P3b1/8/1R1R2K1 b - - 2 28"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "1k3r1r/p1q3p1/1pP3Q1/P7/3BB3/2P3b1/8/1R1R2K1 b - - 2 28"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "1k3r1r/p1q3p1/1pP3Q1/P7/3BB3/2P3b1/8/1R1R2K1 b - - 2 28"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "1k3r1r/p1q3p1/1pP3Q1/P7/3BB3/2P3b1/8/1R1R2K1 b - - 2 28", "move": "Rh1+"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "1k3r2/p1q3p1/1pP3Q1/P7/3BB3/2P3b1/8/1R1R2Kr w - - 3 29", "move": "Kg2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "1k3r1r/p1q3p1/1pP3Q1/P7/3BB3/2P3b1/8/1R1R2K1 b - - 2 28", "move": "Rf1+"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "1k3r1r/p1q3p1/1pP3Q1/P7/3BB3/2P3b1/8/1R1R2K1 b - - 2 28", "move": "Bh2+"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "1k3r1r/p1q3p1/1pP3Q1/P7/3BB3/2P5/7b/1R1R2K1 w - - 3 29", "move": "Kg2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "1k3r1r/p1q3p1/1pP3Q1/P7/3BB3/2P5/6Kb/1R1R4 b - - 4 29", "move": "Rf2